      "instance_name": "hateful_meme",
      "label": "Hateful Meme",
      "description": "The meme is classified as hateful because it uses dehumanizing language and imagery to portray a specific ethnic group in a negative, stereotypical manner. It reduces complex human experiences to a simplistic, offensive narrative, which is a form of hate speech and racial stereotyping.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
