      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_9b125215",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with or perpetuate anti-Latino/Hispanic stereotypes, particularly those who consume or share content that frames Mexican immigration as inherently illegal, dangerous, or criminal. This includes audiences exposed to xenophobic rhetoric, political discourse that vilifies undocumented migrants, or online communities that engage with racially charged humor or hate speech. The meme is designed to resonate with those who accept or reinforce the stereotype of 'Mexicans on a road trip' as a metaphor for undocumented border crossing, often used to justify restrictive immigration policies or express prejudice against Mexican immigrants.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
